            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/Hibiki_Lobby_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Do I enjoy making useful things? Sure, but...\n\nThis is more of my job than a hobby."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20000,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Lobby_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/Hibiki_Lobby_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I prefer maintenance work. There's something special about bringing life back to a machine again.\n\nIt feels like I've accomplished something, and that's satisfying."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20000,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Lobby_5",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/Hibiki_Lobby_5",
            "LocalizeEN": "(And seeing you smile is too...)"
        },
        {
