            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/hibiki_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't like fights, but I also want to help Sensei."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20000,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/hibiki_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "If I were to examine my feelings towards Sensei now, I'm sure they'd be positive."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20000,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/hibiki_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "これからの私はどこで、何をするんだろう?\n誰も分からないと思うけど、私は分かってる。\n先生と一緒に行く。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't think anyone knows where and what they'll be in the future. But I know. I'm going with Sensei."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20000,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/hibiki_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "不思議だね。記憶機能に問題でもあるのかな?\n言いたいことがたくさんあったのに。\n先生の顔を見ると、思い出せなくなるの。",
            "LocalizeEN": "It's strange. Maybe it's a problem with my memory function. There were so many things I wanted to tell you, but since I saw your face I cannot think of anything..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20000,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Hibiki_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hibiki/hibiki_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't believe in fate, but from the moment I met Sensei... I'm grateful for my fate."
        }
    ]
